{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃淑蔓（Feanna）與米爺的合唱歌《旋轉木馬》大受歡迎，可說是本年度的「神曲」！之後她更找來Stone、曾傲棐、床哥、娜娜、晚安莉莉成員阿雞組成「Ichiban Girls」加持，不少圈中人亦有Dance cover，想不到近日Feanna更邀得同門大師姐兼樂壇天后鄭秀文（Sammi）合體拍片跳「旋轉木馬舞」，又一次成就解鎖！</p><figure><img alt=\"黃淑蔓（Feanna）與米爺的合唱歌《旋轉木馬》大受歡迎，可說是本年度的「神曲」！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184623933844885504091874.jpeg/r0InSKXP-rzIzZ939nCkH0gsMX1StepTrL9h6qy_Yeo\"/><figcaption>黃淑蔓（Feanna）與米爺的合唱歌《旋轉木馬》大受歡迎，可說是本年度的「神曲」！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近日Feanna更邀得同門大師姐兼樂壇天后鄭秀文（Sammi）合體拍片跳「旋轉木馬舞」。（IG@feannaswag）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617724555300864905648.jpeg/RJo_oqra840s9ChuFKj5ilzvEXcmPoydDhlFyQ4ZRck\"/><figcaption>近日Feanna更邀得同門大師姐兼樂壇天后鄭秀文（Sammi）合體拍片跳「旋轉木馬舞」。（IG@feannaswag）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"連Sammi都肯一齊跳！（IG@feannaswag）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617727046848512169283.jpeg/rmOnk5r84pRSPEMp9juu7XxnpWB2YmHFjj2jN449ozc\"/><figcaption>連Sammi都肯一齊跳！（IG@feannaswag）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sammi駕輕就熟。（IG@feannaswag）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617729517424640689714.jpeg/JydHCtSDrh1QCwcVg3oAio_H0ogPRQH5gJuyoYCbsqE\"/><figcaption>Sammi駕輕就熟。（IG@feannaswag）</figcaption></figure><p>親自教舞 背後抱Sammi炫耀：邊個有得攬？</p><p>片中可見，Feanna擔任舞蹈導師，以「蘋果」、「心心」等形容親自指導Sammi演繹舞蹈的動作，Sammi當然也相當快上手。去到舞蹈尾聲，Feanna更順勢從背後貼身緊抱 Sammi，且難掩興奮，事後向身邊工作人員自豪炫耀：「有邊個有得攬Sammi？」不過講完後她又非常害羞，尖叫著跑走，她又發文：「蔓蔓攬咗文文Twice 旋轉木馬中相擁夜王(๑&gt;◡&lt;๑)」。花絮片段中更揭露了Feanna在見Sammi前，緊張得不斷練習其新歌《隕石與地球》，而二人合照時，Sammi又熱情反抱Feanna自拍，讓她開心到不知所措，自爆：「我唔記得歌詞……」Sammi則打趣說：「唔練熟佢！」</p><figure><img alt=\"片中可見，Feanna擔任舞蹈導師，以「蘋果」、「心心」等形容親自指導Sammi演繹舞蹈的動作（IG@ highlighter_channel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617734466965504418965.jpeg/U2HMd30fAAhb9EpfzuhisRGlA7voooyZ5Uw80-VMPNM\"/><figcaption>片中可見，Feanna擔任舞蹈導師，以「蘋果」、「心心」等形容親自指導Sammi演繹舞蹈的動作（IG@ highlighter_channel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sammi當然也相當快上手。（IG@ highlighter_channel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617732222881792389704.jpeg/W7silDneyIqO2nl6mdfP0v8XfND9tQ4bH4lZ9x-JWfc\"/><figcaption>Sammi當然也相當快上手。（IG@ highlighter_channel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"去到舞蹈尾聲，Feanna更順勢從背後貼身緊抱 Sammi，且難掩興奮。（IG@feannaswag）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617732067692544921754.jpeg/VHFZ3FJPkJiwZFHHfk2TP2w_LJasDU1DAs_WqwLP1qs\"/><figcaption>去到舞蹈尾聲，Feanna更順勢從背後貼身緊抱 Sammi，且難掩興奮。（IG@feannaswag）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃淑蔓向身邊工作人員自豪炫耀：「有邊個有得攬Sammi？」不過講完後她又非常害羞，尖叫著跑走。（IG@ highlighter_channel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617729639059456914576.jpeg/nhdkFlHLirL86ATOlEvIz7CrihEvM21Xld3u4JXd7uA\"/><figcaption>黃淑蔓向身邊工作人員自豪炫耀：「有邊個有得攬Sammi？」不過講完後她又非常害羞，尖叫著跑走。（IG@ highlighter_channel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"花絮片段中更揭露了Feanna在見Sammi前，緊張得不斷練習其新歌《隕石與地球》。（IG@ highlighter_channel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617727092985856379485.jpeg/1NsNHTWvV4PD-JcXXXaEJ1J87hchK1qa9hcqzfYXKs0\"/><figcaption>花絮片段中更揭露了Feanna在見Sammi前，緊張得不斷練習其新歌《隕石與地球》。（IG@ highlighter_channel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二人合照時，Sammi又熱情反抱Feanna自拍，讓她開心到不知所措，自爆：「我唔記得歌詞……」Sammi則打趣說：「唔練熟佢！」（IG@ highlighter_channel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184617724643381248432718.jpeg/URhWums4nGol89Z3u6KViPutVLF8-EIsp0wRAqdMEQI\"/><figcaption>二人合照時，Sammi又熱情反抱Feanna自拍，讓她開心到不知所措，自爆：「我唔記得歌詞……」Sammi則打趣說：「唔練熟佢！」（IG@ highlighter_channel）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T14:20:04.857957+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1030,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}